<title>USA: Greater Community Bancorp sets stock payout.</title>
<headline>Greater Community Bancorp sets stock payout.</headline>
<dateline>TOTOWA, N.J. 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greater Community Bancorp said Wednesday its board has set a 10 percent stock dividend payable July 31, record July 10.</p>
<p>The bank also said it would maintain its quarterly cash dividend of $0.08 per share on the new total shares outstanding after the stock dividend, representing a 10 percent increase.</p>
<p>The quarterly dividend will also be paid on July 31, record July 10, the bank said.</p>
</text>
